Revert no longer returns the held item an unannounced deny consumed: it
forgets the denied items instead of calling Quarantine::return_denied, so the
item is dropped as deny's release dropped it before 0a9c82a (Return a held
item when revert discards the deny that consumed it). The deny's bumps are
discarded with the pending batch and nothing takes their place. DESIGN.md
§8.3, the last paragraph.

test: delocal-sim regressions::a_revert_that_discards_a_denys_bumps_returns_its_held_item

